msgctxt "quest/047/AktKct103_04732:TEXT_AKTKCT103_04732_CHORAZOI_100_028:1"
msgid "Which means I'll have to ask you to come up with a similar number of <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 38764 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 2)><noun-en Item 3 38765 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 3)><noun-en Item 3 38766 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 4)><noun-en Item 3 38767 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 5)><noun-en Item 3 38768 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 6)><noun-en Item 3 38769 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 7)><noun-en Item 3 38770 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 8)><noun-en Item 3 38771 2 1></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if> to offer in barter."
msgstr "Значит, попрошу вас подготовить примерно столько же <if ($n1 == 1)><noun-en Item 3 38764 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 2)><noun-en Item 3 38765 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 3)><noun-en Item 3 38766 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 4)><noun-en Item 3 38767 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 5)><noun-en Item 3 38768 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 6)><noun-en Item 3 38769 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 7)><noun-en Item 3 38770 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 8)><noun-en Item 3 38771 2 1></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if>, чтобы предложить их в обмен."

#. ja: となると……今回必要となる稀少材料は、<br>「<sheet Item $n1 0>」と、<br>「<sheet Item $n2 0>」が良さそうです！
#. de: In diesem Fall<nbsp>... bräuchten wir <noun-de Item 5 $n1 2 1 1> und <noun-de Item 5 $n2 2 1 1>!
#. fr: Hmm, voyons voirrr... Cette fois, vous allez devoir me rapporter <noun-fr Item 1 $n1 2 1> et <noun-fr Item 1 $n2 2 1>.
#. speaker: CHORAZOI
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 1, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1> — an English noun from a game data sheet, with article and number; sheet = Item, form = 3, row = number parameter 2, count = 2, case = 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/047/AktKct103_04732:TEXT_AKTKCT103_04732_CHORAZOI_000_029:1"
msgid "Let's see here... For the enhancements, I'd say we'll need a sizable stack of <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> and <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1>."
msgstr "Так... Для улучшения нам понадобится побольше <noun-en Item 3 $n1 2 1> и <noun-en Item 3 $n2 2 1>."

#. ja: 商会から稀少材料を提供してもらう取引資本には、<br>「<if ($n1 == 9)><sheet ItemMP 38796 0><else><if ($n1 == 10)><sheet ItemMP 38794 0></if></if>」のご用意を、<br>お願いできますか？
#. de: Als Tauschgut dafür müsstest du einige <if ($n1 == 9)><noun-de ItemMP 5 38796 2 1 1><else><if ($n1 == 10)><noun-de ItemMP 5 38794 2 1 1></if></if> sammeln, wenn das kein Problem ist?
#. fr: Pour les obtenirrr, la maison des merveilles exige <if ($n1 == 9)><noun-fr Item 1 38796 2 1><else><if ($n1 == 10)><noun-fr Item 1 38794 2 1></if></if>. À vous de jouer, champion<if $gn4>ne</if><nbsp>!
#. speaker: CHORAZOI
